textfont=museo_sans_15pt_bold
text=The runes must be in sets of three, I think, but I have had no luck in completing this conundrum. Perhaps, if my Thieving skills were greater, I could in some way interfere with the mechanism. May those who follow have more luck in this accursed place.<br><br>-Toralis of Menaphos
